Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "The Gate of Souls is in the back of the palace.
We'll have to defeat the enemies guarding it!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "The Gate of Souls is in the back of the
palace. We've got our work cut out for us!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Foolish Midna. Allow me to entomb you.
May the Twilight scatter my foes!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Zant? What's that traitor doing protecting
the Gate of Souls?",
  "1.0.4.0" => "I know this palace inside and out, so it only
makes sense for me to command our forces.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "I'll protect the base. But I'm counting on
your support if things get tough!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "So...guard the base and fight alongside the
commander... OK! I won't let you down!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Advance to the east first. We have to
capture the enemy keeps!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Let's advance to the east and capture the
enemy outpost!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "I'll do my best!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Quit stalling! Hurry up and capture the
keep in the east!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "What's the holdup? You've got to capture
the keeps in the east!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Good! Now, can you handle capturing the
other keep to the north?",
  "1.0.13.0" => "The time is nigh... Demolish the bridges!
Cut them off from their base!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Don't let the bridge thing panic you!
Just focus on capturing the keep!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "The bridges may be gone, but we can handle it!
For now, just get that keep right away!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "So...just keep fighting? OK! Chaaaarge!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Oh goody! My team has captured the East
Palace Keep!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "We got a reward for taking the keep?
Good! C'mon, let's open that up!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "A chest, huh? Sure, I can live with that.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "It's an item that lets you cross gaps?
Huh. Convenient. Back to the fallen bridge!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "None shall set foot near the Gate of
Souls! The Twilight King commands it!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Wow, that's some dragon he just summoned...
Say what you want, but he knows his magic...",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Hey, get down here! No fair flying where
we can't kill you!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "It doesn't swoop down long enough to
strike it, so how do we defeat it...?",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Mister Dragon sure likes to fly way up there!
I wish there was some way to reach him...",
  "1.0.27.0" => "OK, how about a taste of my Twilight
abilities!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "I'll create a Magic Circle in the keep directly
underneath him. Somebody give me a hand!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "We'll have to use some clever thinking if
we want to defeat that dragon midflight!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "I'm going to create a Magic Circle in the
keep underneath the dragon! Help me out!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Somebody help me out! I've got monsters
blocking my way!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Monsters are in the way and keeping me
from moving forward! Can someone help?",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Will you be OK without me? If I leave,
you'll be on your own.",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Will you guys be OK without me? You know
you'll be left alone on the front lines...",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Our friends are doing everything they can,
so I'd better do everything I can too!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "How wonderful! Our enemy's base has thinned
out! Send reinforcements and crush it!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Of course he'd attack the moment I step
away... I need to finish that Magic Circle fast!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Oh no! He struck when I was gone! I need
to finish that Magic Circle right away...",
  "1.0.39.0" => "All right, the Magic Circle is done!
Use it to strike down the dragon!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "The Magic Circle is finished!
Use it to attack the dragon!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "How long are you going to leave that flying
lizard out there? Use the Magic Circle!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Our base can't take much more!
Hurry! Strike using the Magic Circle!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Good job! Would have been nice to bring
it down...but oh well...",
  "1.0.44.0" => "You may have chased away Argorok, but
my plan doesn't end there! Oh no!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Yes! I hope we've seen the last of that
dragon...",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Witness the Twilight King's next stratagem!
Capture the enemy commanders!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Oh? The baddies are running right up to
me! Do they want to talk?",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Where did you find this one...? Haaa...
Just don't let the enemy get near her!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Oh no, they're trying to take Agitha!
Don't let them get near her!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Hey, what do you think you're doing?!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "She got herself kidnapped. Well, that's just
great! That really weakens our eastern side.",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Agitha has been captured! That'll really give
the enemy an advantage on our east flank...",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Whatever is the matter? That baddie invited
me to a tea party! Has it been canceled?",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Ah, your wounds appear to have healed...
Good. Now strike their base again!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Not the dragon again... Grrrr! I'm so sick
of it!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "You gotta use the Magic Circle! Take the
keep that's right below the dragon!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Same plan as last time! Got it!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "You can attack the dragon with the Magic
Circle in the Central Square!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Well, duh! I could have told you that!
Just leave the dragon to me!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "It's going for our base again...
I'll chase it off in no time!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "It's attacking our base again!
We've got to repel that dragon quickly!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "OK! The Magic Circle is ready!
Take it down for good this time!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "The Magic Circle is operational again! Use
its magic to defeat the dragon for good!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "How long are you gonna leave that thing
out there?! Use the Magic Circle already!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "I could really use one less dragon about now...
Quick, defeat it using the Magic Circle!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Who let it get away?! If we could reach it,
we could kill that thing and be done with it...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "It got away again?!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Hmm... If we want to slay the dragon, we
have to bring it down to our level...",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Gah, this is the third time! I'm getting
really fed up with this!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Hmm, third time... How long are we going
to keep this cycle going?",
  "1.0.75.0" => "We drive him off, and he comes right back...
He's just as stubborn as some flies I know!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "The Magic Circle isn't getting the job done.
We need a new strategy...",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Attacking with the Magic Circle is getting
us nowhere... Is there some other way...?",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Li'l Butterfly has something to say! Yes?
Hmm... She wants to lead us somewhere!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "OK, let's follow the butterfly. It should
know where the Fairy Fountain is!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "The butterfly flew to the building in the
southeast! We'll just have to trust it again!",
  "1.0.84.0" => "The Magic Circle in the Fairy Fountain
should help us kill that cursed dragon!",
  "1.0.85.0" => "The Magic Circle in the Fairy Fountain
should help us defeat the dragon!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "Strike alongside Argorok! Make them draw
their last ragged breaths!",
  "1.0.87.0" => "All we've got left is our base! If we can't
hold that, we'll lose the battle!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "Only our base is left standing...
Protect it through sheer will if we have to!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "They've grown too weak to fight back!
Wear them down...and extinguish them!",
  "1.0.90.0" => "Zant, that snake... He thinks he's on a
roll...",
  "1.0.91.0" => "He won't make a fool of us! Let's take one
of his outposts and see how he likes it!",
  "1.0.92.0" => "Look!",
  "1.0.93.0" => "How's that, Zant?! Next time I'll take more
than just your outpost!",
  "1.0.94.0" => "See? We have the will to pull through this!",
  "1.0.95.0" => "Grr... You dare mock my forces?
MY forces?!",
  "1.0.96.0" => "Look! The Magic Circle worked! The
dragon's been pulled low to the ground!",
  "1.0.97.0" => "Our attacks should finally be able to reach it!
Now's our chance to finish that dragon off!",
  "1.0.98.0" => "How did they manage to pull Argorok down
to their level?!",
  "1.0.99.0" => "I'll lead you myself if I have to! Charge!
Your king will show you how it's done!",
  "1.0.100.0" => "The dragon's down, and Zant's moving in.
If we defeat them both, we've won this!",
  "1.0.101.0" => "If we kill both the dragon and Zant, we've
won this. We can do it!",
  "1.0.102.0" => "You...worthless...wretches... I am the Twilight
King! I will not be mocked by yooooooooou!",
  "1.0.103.0" => "Your greed was your downfall. Now go find a
shadow so deep you'll never see light again!",
  "1.0.104.0" => "Your greed corrupted you...
You and Cia both...",
  "1.0.106.0" => "We finally beat it... Third time's the
charm, eh?",
  "1.0.107.0" => "Finally, we won... Nice teamwork, everyone!",
  "1.0.108.0" => "We beat the enemy commander! The Gate
of Souls should be left unguarded now!",
  "1.0.109.0" => "We beat all the strongest foes! Now we
should be able to seal the Gate of Souls!",
  "1.0.110.0" => "Our base is in trouble!
Tighten the defenses!",
  "1.0.111.0" => "Enemies are swarming our base!
We've got to defend it!",
  "1.0.112.0" => "We'll lose if the base falls! Someone has
to defend it immediately, and it can't be me!",
  "1.0.113.0" => "Our base is on the brink of falling!
Someone has to do something to save it!",
  "1.0.114.0" => "I messed up... I'm sorry...everyone...",
  "1.0.115.0" => "How could I lose... I let everyone down...",
  "1.0.117.0" => "Our base fell? That's it. It's over.",
  "1.0.118.0" => "We lost the base...?
Then we've lost...",
  "1.0.119.0" => "Huh? We control the keep, but the gate won't
budge! Guess we need an alternate route...",
  "1.0.120.0" => "But the bridge we used is out now!
What are we going to do? Hmm...",
  "1.0.121.0" => "Midna, are you friends with that eccentric
person in the freaky mask?",
  "1.0.122.0" => "Friends? HA! That's Zant, the traitor who
stole my throne in the Twilight Realm!",
  "1.0.123.0" => "That big lizard really did a number on our
allies... But we can't let that stop us!",
  "1.0.124.0" => "Looks like we squeaked by, huh?",
  "1.0.125.0" => "Hey! Someone's got to do something;
otherwise our base is going to fall!",
  "1.0.126.0" => "Go! Reclaim our keeps! Do it for your
one and rightful king!",
  "1.0.127.0" => "I don't think so! Don't let the enemy take
ANYTHING back! Shut them down!",
  "1.0.128.0" => "Were you talking to me? Oh! Then I'd
better help, hadn't I? Ha ha, OK!",
  "1.0.129.0" => "Such brazenness from that little girl... She
offends me! Someone! Take care of her!",
  "1.0.130.0" => "Hee hee! I'm ever so happy to have helped!",
  "1.0.131.0" => "I'll mow through the enemies coming from
the west, so someone, defend our base!",
  "1.0.132.0" => "Oh! I'd better stop the enemies coming
from the middle, hadn't I?",
  "1.0.133.0" => "I'll wipe out the dragon, so go show
Zant who's boss!",
  "1.0.134.0" => "They've practically hand delivered their base
to us. Ha ha! Someone, go retrieve it for us!",
  "1.0.135.0" => "Grrrr... Zant... Hey, somebody!
Go keep our base safe!",
  "1.0.136.0" => "We'll defeat that thing for sure this time!
Everyone, gather near the Argorok!",
  "1.0.137.0" => "Grr... If I don't get back quickly, the
base will be lost!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "The Gate of Souls is in the back of the palace.
Let's defeat the one guarding it and close it!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "I'll protect the base, but I'll need your
help if things get rough!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "We should go to the east first and capture
the enemy keeps. Ready? Let's go!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Oh, come on! Hurry and capture the Eastern
Keep! You didn't get distracted, did you?",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The bridge is down, but don't worry about
it! You just focus on getting that keep!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "A chest? Heh, don't mind if I do...",
  "13.0.6.0" => "We're being attacked from the air! How are
we supposed to combat that...?",
  "13.0.7.0" => "We'll have to use magic if we want to
damage the dragon in midflight!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "I'll create a Magic Circle in the keep
underneath the dragon! Buy some time!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Monsters are in my way! Can someone do
me a favor and get rid of them?",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Will you dainty little flowers be OK without
me holding your hands on the front lines?",
  "13.0.11.0" => "He struck when I was gone! Darn! I need
to finish that Magic Circle immediately...",
  "13.0.12.0" => "The Magic Circle is finished! Use it to really
give that dragon something to roar about!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Our base can't take much more!
Hurry--someone use the Magic Circle!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Wonderful! I hope that's the last we'll
hear from our friend the dragon...",
  "13.0.15.0" => "Oh no, they're trying to take Agitha!
Keep the monsters away from her!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Agitha's been taken! Dang... That'll really
please the enemies in the east...",
  "13.0.17.0" => "The Magic Circles are key! Capture the
keep that's directly below the dragon!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Same plan as last time? Too easy!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "It wants to attack the base again...
We have to hit it hard and hit it fast!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "The Magic Circle is ready! Make this one
really count!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "That's about all I can do... Quick, defeat
that dragon with the Magic Circle!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Look! The magic attack worked! We should
be able to hit the dragon with normal attacks!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Third time, huh? Haaaa... How many times
will we have to go through this?",
  "13.0.24.0" => "The Magic Circle doesn't seem to have the
effect we want, but what else can we do?",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Let's just follow the butterfly to the building
in the southeast! Trust it knows something!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "A Magic Circle in the Fairy Fountain...
That should help us take down Argorok!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Our base is the last building standing!
DO NOT LET IT FALL!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "See? We can pull through this!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We just need to defeat Argorok and Zant...
Hey, that won't be too hard, right?",
  "13.0.30.0" => "You're a product of your own greed... You
and Cia both.",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Yes! Nice work, everyone!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "We cleared out anyone in our way!
Now let's seal the Gate of Souls!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "We've got enemies swarming the base!
Someone defend it!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Our base is on the brink of falling!
It needs someone to defend it immediately!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "I've let everyone down... I'm so sorry...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Our base fell...? Then this fight is over...",
  "13.0.37.0" => "That dragon wounded our friends at the
Allied Base! We can't let the base fall!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "Wow. Looks like we did it somehow.",
  "13.0.39.0" => "Oh no! If we don't do something fast,
our base is done for!",
  "13.0.40.0" => "I'll do something about that dragon if you
promise to take care of Zant!",
  "13.0.41.0" => "We can't let our base fall! Someone, hurry
and protect it!",
  "13.0.42.0" => "We need to get back, or the base is in
trouble!",
}